<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 360, paddingTop: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 12 }}>OPENAI DEVDAY 2023</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        历史回看：<br />一切 Agent 的起点
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        2023 年 DevDay 是分水岭：模型能力、应用生态、Agent 雏形，三大件一次发布。三年后看，都在为「Agent 时代」铺路。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='bolt' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>GPT-4 Turbo</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>128K 上下文 + JSON 模式，为「结构化输出」立了标准。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='store' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>GPTs + GPT Store + Builder</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>无代码定制助手 + 应用商店，第一次把「造 AI」开放给大众。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='robot' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>Assistants API</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>工具调用 + 线程 + 检索，Agent 的雏形——三年后被 Agent 全面演进。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 10 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>02 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
